  "interpretations": [
    "HB12618/27/72teeth at4-5DP are geometrically consistent:72=18+2*27; with ring fixed the derived ratio1+72/18=5 agrees with HB119.",
    "Three equally spaced planets per side satisfy the phase condition(72+18)/3=30. Equal120deg spacing and tooth clocking are reconstruction choices.",
    "HB120 states the same bolt passes through the annular ring and both case halves. SNL253 supplies four M315gaskets, modeled as two per ring flange."
  ],
